{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由麥玲玲與Bob（林盛斌）擔任大會司儀，「華納三寶」MC張天賦、陳蕾及洪嘉豪合體，及馮允謙、胡鴻鈞、吳業坤、Tyson Yoshi壓軸登場的《赴新向前 · 燃動灣區——2027跨年演唱會》演唱會將於2026年12月31日晚上20:30在江門體育中心體育場舉行，會在大麥網、貓眼、攜程旅行、抖音開始公開發售，即刻看內文了解如何搶飛、場地座位表及交通！</p><figure><img alt=\"燃動灣區跨年演唱會2026江門（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199311385918574592726158.jpeg/vkeuSE2oQKkMzZ-LNMUzs27gtzIZ9CoiLLngTiy54E4\"/><figcaption>燃動灣區跨年演唱會2026江門（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>跨年演唱會2026江門 | 詳情</p><p>演唱會日期：2026年12月31日\n演唱會時間：晚上20:30\n演唱會地點：江門體育中心體育場\n門票價錢：CNY ¥288 / ¥388 / ¥588 / ¥688 / ¥888</p><p>跨年演唱會2026江門 | 公開售票</p><p>公開發售平台：大麥網、貓眼、攜程旅行\n公開開賣日期：2026年11月17日\n公開開賣時間：早上10:28</p><figure><img alt=\"MC張天賦（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199314670344081408584637.jpeg/zZjxR--9x_-jNLew4PXV8cSLXbDJ8sy2lrFBfZaxQX0\"/><figcaption>MC張天賦（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳蕾（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199314663418892288493076.jpeg/VljHNtdN1f6G0K6d1QD9KpFAsLWZq9SnwHRrUMB0a1A\"/><figcaption>陳蕾（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"洪嘉豪（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199314671304577024015469.jpeg/iDIBM0nLFFVNxZVUgjAON8u0b3X8EUEbbgA9rG4APaw\"/><figcaption>洪嘉豪（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"麥玲玲（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199314673733210112846907.jpeg/TaygWywQF3i5U7aG5zS9AHlpBdaWlAMg3tUnJd7VJyU\"/><figcaption>麥玲玲（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Bob林盛斌（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199314669047910400463509.jpeg/FP5fbvqRPlmTY-HpBCCChqSQJCCm_d7v5xBuOucQbjo\"/><figcaption>Bob林盛斌（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jay Fung馮允謙（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199314665910439936457926.jpeg/9plLaqQTc1t6MQqbdYgHsHRr_oX2ZCgjziS1Jc4ktSU\"/><figcaption>Jay Fung馮允謙（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tyson Yoshi（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199314668053860352271348.jpeg/MloPCoR89JUW0Avru3kCKl0VaNn0245RJ5G0mCeRtJg\"/><figcaption>Tyson Yoshi（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"胡鴻鈞（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199314664253558784371289.jpeg/mAOogeoeYxNyAIcwmCdhkneI_yUcaX2V4bsa7-G7Gu8\"/><figcaption>胡鴻鈞（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳業坤（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199314666732523520051389.jpeg/VmA_wpNLCWav6iCOnw5ejg1ecgBcfRj5Eq4nMhKuJzI\"/><figcaption>吳業坤（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>跨年演唱會2026江門 | 座位表</p><figure><img alt=\"演唱會座位表（大麥）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199311383615770624364078.jpeg/HKqBjZQY7yf3Zbl0hnagNVdMZq56bTzi8XL98vFy_fI\"/><figcaption>演唱會座位表（大麥）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:19:30.842466+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":514,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:40:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:23:00.941263+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:57.191173+00:00","content_hash":"2eebb319e6575374b1db528cc390f0153294205daa1da12b96253aeff1d406ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}